- Frontmatter formatting: follow the OpenCode skill format's YAML rules. Keep `description` as one YAML scalar; quote it or use `description: >-` with indented continuation lines when punctuation or wrapping requires it.
- Mode skills are heavy and opinionated; they should only apply when the user explicitly invokes them (by name or slash command), not auto-trigger on description matching. Write the `description` to trigger on the explicit invocation ("Use for /<handle>-mode or requests to work in this style"), not on adjacent topics. Opt out only if the user explicitly wants their mode to apply on every turn.
